  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><size=130%>HOW TO PLAY</size></b>



    <b>Goal</b>

    Sort the
    rubbish into the correct bins in the correct order to unlock the exit door before
    time runs out.



    <b>Steps</b>

    1. Find the <b>clue note</b> and read
    it to see the required order.

    2. Find the right rubbish around the room
    and pick it up.

    3. Throw or drop it into the matching bin.

    4. Repeat
    until the whole order is done, then the door unlocks.

    5. Go to the door
    and press E to enter the next room.



    <b><size=130%>CONTROLS</size></b>



    <b>W
    A S D</b> - Move

    <b>Mouse</b> - Look around

    <b>Left Shift</b> - Run

    <b>Space</b>
    - Jump

    <b>C / Left Ctrl</b> - Crouch (hold)

    <b>E</b> - Pick up item
    / Read note / Use door

    <b>G</b> - Drop item

    <b>Left Click</b> - Throw
    item

    <b>Esc</b> - Pause / Close note



    <b><size=130%>RULES</size></b>



    -
    You can only carry <b>one item</b> at a time.

    - Bins: <b>Paper, Cardboard,
    Plastic</b>. Look at a bin to read what it is for.

    - <b>Wrong bin, wrong
    order, or useless rubbish</b> costs you <color=#FF5555>-15 seconds</color>.

    -
    The timer keeps running while you read the clue note.

    - When time reaches
    0, the teacher catches you and it''s <b>Game Over</b>.

    - The timer stops
    once the door unlocks.



    <b><size=130%>TIPS</size></b>



    - Aim at any
    object to see what it is.

    - Check each item''s name to work out its material.

    -
    Rejected items pop back out of the bin, so nothing is lost.

    - Crouch to
    reach items under desks.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
